<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Wheelock and Co..</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Wheelock and Co..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Gurnsey has issued 380 million American-style call warrants, on Wheelock and Co. Ltd, lead manager Credit Lyonnais Securities (Asia) said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$25.41		  PREMIUM	25 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.3465		 GEARING	6.66 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG		 SPOT REF     HK$23.10</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    10,000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
